Subject: [PATCH 2/2] test(mcp): locate refusal leaves the document unchanged;
 a pickable mate still seats

Review round on PR #863: the pinning test now also asserts get_job is
equal before and after the refused locate, that the boss's flat bottom
seats on the vise top at Z 20, and that one undo restores the
placements (the refusal added no History step).

Refs #692

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
